{"id":"096387ba1b2d18f5","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-sw-biquant.md","title":"Aut(E) 的基数及原索引界反证","display":"thm-sw-biquant — Aut(E) 的基数及原索引界反证","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-sw-biquant","aliases":["20-thm-sw-biquant"],"display":"thm-sw-biquant — Aut(E) 的基数及原索引界反证","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.ce-lattice","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"corrected-counterexample","source_reference":"原断言的基数反证；本地证明","depends_on":["[[20-df-automorphism]]","[[20-df-lattice-re]]","[[20-lem-cohesive-exists]]","[[20-df-arith]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-sw-biquant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-sw-biquant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sw-biquant — Aut(E) 的基数及原索引界反证"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.ce-lattice"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"corrected-counterexample"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"原断言的基数反证；本地证明"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64f5512c46390bf2\" href=\"?note=64f5512c46390bf2\" title=\"20-df-automorphism\">20-df-automorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2db5f72c1596f66e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"27476a93ed7d19d4\" href=\"?note=27476a93ed7d19d4\" title=\"20-lem-cohesive-exists\">20-lem-cohesive-exists</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>自动同构作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E\">\\(\\mathbb E\\)</span>；函数的算术性指其配对编码图属于相应自然数集合类。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f5512c46390bf2\" href=\"?note=64f5512c46390bf2\" title=\"20-df-automorphism\">20-df-automorphism</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2db5f72c1596f66e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"27476a93ed7d19d4\" href=\"?note=27476a93ed7d19d4\" title=\"20-lem-cohesive-exists\">20-lem-cohesive-exists</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"832f53dc90c8947a\" href=\"?note=832f53dc90c8947a\" title=\"20-df-arith\">20-df-arith</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sw\\text{-}biquant}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n|\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb E)|=2^{\\aleph_0},\\\\\n\\neg\\forall\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb E)\\\n\\exists\\theta:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:\\theta(x)=y\\}\\in\\Delta^0_3\\land\\forall e\\ \\Phi(W_e)=W_{\\theta(e)}].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sw\\text{-}biquant}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n|\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb E)|=2^{\\aleph_0},\\\\\n\\neg\\forall\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb E)\\\n\\exists\\theta:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:\\theta(x)=y\\}\\in\\Delta^0_3\\land\\forall e\\ \\Phi(W_e)=W_{\\theta(e)}].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>E 可数，给出基数上界。取无限 cohesive C，任意置换 C 且固定其补集，则每个 c.e. 集的像仅与原集合差有限，故仍 c.e.；反置换同样保持，给出连续统多个不同自动同构。Δ3 函数却只有可数多个，每个索引映射最多确定一个格自动同构，故原“所有自动同构都有 Δ3 索引表示”错误。本结果为本地证明，移除无来源的 Slaman–Woodin 冠名。</p>\n<p>来源：原断言的基数反证；本地证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-automorphism","status":"resolved","id":"64f5512c46390bf2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-automorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-lattice-re","status":"resolved","id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-lattice-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-cohesive-exists","status":"resolved","id":"27476a93ed7d19d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-cohesive-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-automorphism","status":"resolved","id":"64f5512c46390bf2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-automorphism]]；see [[20-df-lattice-re]]；see [[20-lem-cohesive-exists]]；see [[20-df-arith]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-lattice-re","status":"resolved","id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-automorphism]]；see [[20-df-lattice-re]]；see [[20-lem-cohesive-exists]]；see [[20-df-arith]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-cohesive-exists","status":"resolved","id":"27476a93ed7d19d4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-automorphism]]；see [[20-df-lattice-re]]；see [[20-lem-cohesive-exists]]；see [[20-df-arith]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith","status":"resolved","id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-automorphism]]；see [[20-df-lattice-re]]；see [[20-lem-cohesive-exists]]；see [[20-df-arith]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sw\\text{-}biquant}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n|\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb E)|=2^{\\aleph_0},\\\\\n\\neg\\forall\\Phi\\in\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb E)\\\n\\exists\\theta:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:\\theta(x)=y\\}\\in\\Delta^0_3\\land\\forall e\\ \\Phi(W_e)=W_{\\theta(e)}].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1696,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["64f5512c46390bf2","2db5f72c1596f66e","27476a93ed7d19d4","832f53dc90c8947a"]}